#. module: bf_property_access_expedibox
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_property_access_expedibox/models/bf_property_access_connector.py:0
msgid " (casier d'essai)"
msgstr " (test locker)"

#. module: bf_property_access_expedibox
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_property_access_expedibox/models/bf_property_organisation.py:0
msgid ""
"Au départ confirmé, le logiciel retire le destinataire du casier. Il ne "
"touche jamais un destinataire qu'il n'a pas inscrit lui-même (rapprochement "
"par identifiant), et il signale au responsable ceux qu'aucun droit ne "
"réclame plus au lieu de les supprimer de lui-même."
msgstr ""
"Once the departure is confirmed, the software removes the recipient from "
"the locker. It never touches a recipient it did not register itself "
"(matched by identifier), and it reports to the person responsible those "
"that no right claims any more instead of deleting them on its own."

#. module: bf_property_access_expedibox
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_property_access_expedibox/models/bf_property_access_connector.py:0
msgid ""
"Aucune inscription de ce droit repérable au casier : elle a pu y être faite "
"à la main. Vérifiez au casier et retirez-y la personne s'il y est inscrite."
msgstr ""
"No registration for this right can be found at the locker: it may have "
"been made there by hand. Check at the locker and remove the person if they "
"are registered."

#. module: bf_property_access_expedibox
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_property_access_expedibox/models/bf_property_organisation.py:0
msgid "Boîte à colis connectée (Expedibox) : %s"
msgstr "Parcel locker connected (Expedibox): %s"

#. module: bf_property_access_expedibox
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_property_access_expedibox/models/bf_property_access_connector.py:0
msgid ""
"Casier %(locker)s : %(n)s destinataire(s) inscrit(s) par ce logiciel ne "
"correspondent à aucun droit en vigueur (%(refs)s). Vérifiez au casier : s'il"
" s'agit de personnes parties, retirez-les. Le logiciel n'y touche pas de "
"lui-même."
msgstr ""
"Locker %(locker)s: %(n)s recipient(s) registered by this software match no "
"right in force (%(refs)s). Check at the locker: if they are people who "
"have moved out, remove them. The software does not touch them on its own."

#. module: bf_property_access_expedibox
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_property_access_expedibox/models/bf_property_access_connector.py:0
msgid ""
"Casier %(locker)s : l'inscription de %(who)s a été corrigée (%(champs)s)."
msgstr ""
"Locker %(locker)s: the registration of %(who)s was corrected (%(champs)s)."

#. module: bf_property_access_expedibox
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_property_access_expedibox/models/bf_property_access_connector.py:0
msgid "Casiers Expedibox"
msgstr "Expedibox lockers"

#. module: bf_property_access_expedibox
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_property_access_expedibox.view_access_connector_form_expedibox
msgid "Casiers du jeton"
msgstr "Lockers this token sees"

#. module: bf_property_access_expedibox
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_property_access_expedibox/models/bf_property_access_connector.py:0
msgid "Ce connecteur n'a pas de jeton d'application."
msgstr "This connector has no application token."

#. module: bf_property_access_expedibox
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_property_access_expedibox/models/bf_property_access_connector.py:0
msgid "Ce connecteur n'est pas un connecteur Expedibox."
msgstr "This connector is not an Expedibox connector."

#. module: bf_property_access_expedibox
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:bf_property_access_expedibox.field_bf_property_access_connector__expedibox_organization_id
msgid ""
"Ce qu'Expedibox envoie dans l'en-tête X-Expedibox-Organization-Id de ses "
"avis. Noté ici pour rapprocher un avis de dépôt de cette organisation ; le "
"connecteur lui-même ne s'en sert pas."
msgstr ""
"What Expedibox sends in the X-Expedibox-Organization-Id header of its "
"notices. Recorded here to match a deposit notice to this organisation; the "
"connector itself does not use it."

#. module: bf_property_access_expedibox
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_property_access_expedibox/models/bf_property_organisation.py:0
msgid ""
"Ce que le casier montre : son écran sert au livreur à choisir le "
"destinataire, donc le nom du résident y paraît, et le réglage d'affichage "
"appartient au casier, pas au logiciel. À vérifier chez le fournisseur et à "
"nommer ici."
msgstr ""
"What the locker shows: its screen is how a courier picks the recipient, so "
"the resident's name appears on it, and the display setting belongs to the "
"locker, not to the software. To be checked with the supplier and named "
"here."

#. module: bf_property_access_expedibox
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:bf_property_access_expedibox.field_bf_property_access_connector__expedibox_contact
msgid "Ce que le casier reçoit pour joindre le résident"
msgstr "What the locker is given to reach the resident"

#. module: bf_property_access_expedibox
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_property_access_expedibox/models/bf_property_organisation.py:0
msgid ""
"Ce que le logiciel transmet au casier, à l'arrivée du résident : prénom, "
"nom, logement, %s, et un identifiant de rapprochement propre à ce logiciel. "
"Aucun numéro fixe, aucune date de bail, aucun code."
msgstr ""
"What the software sends the locker when the resident moves in: first name, "
"last name, unit, %s, and a matching identifier of its own. No landline, no "
"lease date, no code."

#. module: bf_property_access_expedibox
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_property_access_expedibox/models/bf_property_access_connector.py:0
msgid ""
"Ces points d'accès sont reliés à « %(connector)s » et ne peuvent pas l'être "
"à un casier Expedibox (il leur faut le type « Boîte à colis » et "
"l'identifiant de leur casier) : %(points)s."
msgstr ""
"These access points are wired to \"%(connector)s\" and cannot be wired to "
"an Expedibox locker (they need the \"Parcel locker\" type and their locker "
"id): %(points)s."

#. module: bf_property_access_expedibox
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_property_access_expedibox/models/bf_property_access_grant.py:0
msgid ""
"Cette base n'a pas d'identifiant (database.uuid) : le casier ne peut pas "
"distinguer ses inscriptions de celles d'une autre base."
msgstr ""
"This database has no identifier (database.uuid): the locker cannot tell "
"its registrations from another database's."

#. module: bf_property_access_expedibox
#: model:ir.model,name:bf_property_access_expedibox.model_bf_property_access_connector
msgid "Connecteur d'accès"
msgstr "Access connector"

#. module: bf_property_access_expedibox
#: model:ir.model.fields.selection,name:bf_property_access_expedibox.selection__bf_property_access_connector__expedibox_contact__email_first
msgid "Courriel ; le mobile seulement s'il n'y a pas de courriel"
msgstr "E-mail; the mobile only when there is no e-mail"

#. module: bf_property_access_expedibox
#: model:ir.model.fields.selection,name:bf_property_access_expedibox.selection__bf_property_access_connector__expedibox_contact__both
msgid "Courriel et numéro de mobile"
msgstr "E-mail and mobile number"

#. module: bf_property_access_expedibox
#: model:ir.model,name:bf_property_access_expedibox.model_bf_property_access_grant
msgid "Droit d'accès"
msgstr "Access right"

#. module: bf_property_access_expedibox
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_property_access_expedibox/models/bf_property_access_connector.py:0
msgid "Déjà inscrit au casier (destinataire %(ref)s), corrigé : %(champs)s."
msgstr ""
"Already registered with the locker (recipient %(ref)s), corrected: "
"%(champs)s."

#. module: bf_property_access_expedibox
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_property_access_expedibox/models/bf_property_access_connector.py:0
msgid "Déjà inscrit au casier (destinataire %s)."
msgstr "Already registered with the locker (recipient %s)."

#. module: bf_property_access_expedibox
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_property_access_expedibox/models/bf_property_access_connector.py:0
msgid "Déjà retiré du casier (le destinataire %s n'y est plus)."
msgstr "Already removed from the locker (recipient %s is gone)."

#. module: bf_property_access_expedibox
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_property_access_expedibox.view_access_connector_form_expedibox
msgid "Expedibox"
msgstr "Expedibox"

#. module: bf_property_access_expedibox
#: model:ir.model.fields.selection,name:bf_property_access_expedibox.selection__bf_property_access_connector__kind__expedibox
msgid "Expedibox : boîte à colis"
msgstr "Expedibox: parcel locker"

#. module: bf_property_access_expedibox
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_property_access_expedibox/models/bf_property_access_connector.py:0
msgid "Expedibox : destinataires sans droit"
msgstr "Expedibox: recipients with no right"

#. module: bf_property_access_expedibox
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_property_access_expedibox/models/bf_property_access_connector.py:0
msgid ""
"Expedibox exige un courriel ou un numéro de mobile pour aviser %s d'un colis"
" : la fiche n'en a aucun. Ajoutez-en un à la fiche, puis demandez à un "
"gestionnaire de renvoyer l'ordre à l'appareil."
msgstr ""
"Expedibox requires an e-mail or a mobile number to tell %s a parcel is "
"waiting: the record has neither. Add one to the record, then ask a manager "
"to resend the order to the device."

#. module: bf_property_access_expedibox
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:bf_property_access_expedibox.field_bf_property_access_connector__expedibox_contact
msgid ""
"Expedibox exige un moyen de joindre le résident pour l'aviser d'un colis. "
"Par défaut, le logiciel n'en communique qu'un (art. 5 de la Loi sur la "
"protection des renseignements personnels dans le secteur privé : le minimum "
"nécessaire)."
msgstr ""
"Expedibox requires a way to reach the resident, because the locker itself "
"tells them a parcel is waiting. By default the software discloses only one "
"(art. 5 of the Act respecting the protection of personal information in "
"the private sector: no more than necessary)."

#. module: bf_property_access_expedibox
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_property_access_expedibox/models/bf_property_access_connector.py:0
msgid ""
"Expedibox exige un prénom et un nom : la fiche de « %s » n'en donne pas."
msgstr ""
"Expedibox requires a first and a last name: the record of \"%s\" gives "
"neither."

#. module: bf_property_access_expedibox
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_property_access_expedibox/models/bf_property_access_connector.py:0
msgid "Expedibox n'a pas répondu : %s"
msgstr "Expedibox did not answer: %s"

#. module: bf_property_access_expedibox
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:bf_property_access_expedibox.field_bf_property_access_connector__expedibox_organization_id
msgid "Identifiant d'organisation Expedibox"
msgstr "Expedibox organisation id"

#. module: bf_property_access_expedibox
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:bf_property_access_expedibox.field_bf_property_access_point__expedibox_locker_id
msgid "Identifiant du casier Expedibox"
msgstr "Expedibox locker id"

#. module: bf_property_access_expedibox
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_property_access_expedibox/models/bf_property_access_connector.py:0
msgid "Inscrit au casier (destinataire %s)."
msgstr "Registered with the locker (recipient %s)."

#. module: bf_property_access_expedibox
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:bf_property_access_expedibox.field_bf_property_access_connector__expedibox_app_token
msgid "Jeton d'application (X-App-Token)"
msgstr "Application token (X-App-Token)"

#. module: bf_property_access_expedibox
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:bf_property_access_expedibox.field_bf_property_access_point__expedibox_locker_id
msgid ""
"L'identifiant que le portail d'Expedibox donne au casier (« Installation "
"details »). Le bouton « Casiers du jeton » du connecteur en donne la liste."
msgstr ""
"The id Expedibox's portal gives the locker (\"Installation details\"). The "
"connector's \"Lockers this token sees\" button lists them."

#. module: bf_property_access_expedibox
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_property_access_expedibox/models/bf_property_access_connector.py:0
msgid ""
"La référence %(ref)s ne désigne pas l'inscription de ce droit (identifiant "
"attendu : %(id)s) : le module n'y touche pas. Retrait à faire à la main au "
"casier."
msgstr ""
"Reference %(ref)s is not this right's registration (expected identifier: "
"%(id)s): the module leaves it alone. Remove it by hand at the locker."

#. module: bf_property_access_expedibox
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_property_access_expedibox/models/bf_property_access_point.py:0
msgid ""
"Le connecteur « %(connector)s » est un connecteur de boîte à colis : le "
"point « %(point)s » doit être de type « Boîte à colis »."
msgstr ""
"Connector \"%(connector)s\" is a parcel locker connector: point "
"\"%(point)s\" has to be of the \"Parcel locker\" type."

#. module: bf_property_access_expedibox
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_property_access_expedibox/models/bf_property_access_connector.py:0
msgid ""
"Le connecteur « %s » n'a pas de jeton d'application Expedibox : le casier ne"
" peut pas être joint."
msgstr ""
"Connector \"%s\" has no Expedibox application token: the locker cannot be "
"reached."

#. module: bf_property_access_expedibox
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_property_access_expedibox/models/bf_property_access_connector.py:0
msgid ""
"Le destinataire %(ref)s est inscrit au casier %(autre)s, pas au casier "
"%(attendu)s de ce point : le module n'y touche pas. Retrait à faire à la "
"main sur le bon casier."
msgstr ""
"Recipient %(ref)s is registered with locker %(autre)s, not with locker "
"%(attendu)s of this point: the module leaves it alone. Remove it by hand "
"at the right locker."

#. module: bf_property_access_expedibox
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_property_access_expedibox/models/bf_property_access_connector.py:0
msgid "Le jeton ne voit aucun casier."
msgstr "This token sees no locker."

#. module: bf_property_access_expedibox
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_property_access_expedibox/models/bf_property_access_connector.py:0
msgid ""
"Le point d'accès « %s » n'a pas d'identifiant de casier Expedibox (bouton « "
"Casiers du jeton » sur le connecteur)."
msgstr ""
"Access point \"%s\" has no Expedibox locker id (see the connector's "
"\"Lockers this token sees\" button)."

#. module: bf_property_access_expedibox
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_property_access_expedibox/models/bf_property_access_point.py:0
msgid ""
"Le point « %s » est relié à Expedibox : il lui faut l'identifiant de son "
"casier."
msgstr "Point \"%s\" is wired to Expedibox: it needs its locker id."

#. module: bf_property_access_expedibox
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:bf_property_access_expedibox.field_bf_property_access_point__connector_kind
msgid ""
"Lu par la vue : l'identifiant du casier ne se montre que pour un connecteur "
"Expedibox."
msgstr ""
"Read by the view: the locker id only shows for an Expedibox connector."

#. module: bf_property_access_expedibox
#: model:ir.model,name:bf_property_access_expedibox.model_bf_property_organisation
msgid "Organisation responsable d'un immeuble"
msgstr "Organisation answering for an immovable"

#. module: bf_property_access_expedibox
#: model:ir.model,name:bf_property_access_expedibox.model_bf_property_access_point
msgid "Point d'accès"
msgstr "Access point"

#. module: bf_property_access_expedibox
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:bf_property_access_expedibox.field_bf_property_access_connector__expedibox_app_token
msgid ""
"Portail développeur d'Expedibox : l'application, le casier, « Installation "
"details ». Un jeton par organisation."
msgstr ""
"Expedibox's developer portal: the application, the locker, \"Installation "
"details\". One token per organisation."

#. module: bf_property_access_expedibox
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_property_access_expedibox.view_access_connector_form_expedibox
msgid "Portail développeur, « Installation details »"
msgstr "Developer portal, \"Installation details\""

#. module: bf_property_access_expedibox
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_property_access_expedibox/models/bf_property_organisation.py:0
msgid ""
"Pourquoi un moyen de joindre la personne : le casier l'avise lui-même qu'un "
"colis l'attend. Sans courriel ni mobile, Expedibox refuse l'inscription et "
"l'ordre revient au responsable du point."
msgstr ""
"Why a way to reach the person is needed: the locker itself tells them a "
"parcel is waiting. Without an e-mail or a mobile, Expedibox refuses the "
"registration and the order goes back to the point's manager."

#. module: bf_property_access_expedibox
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_property_access_expedibox/models/bf_property_access_connector.py:0
msgid "Retiré du casier (destinataire %s)."
msgstr "Removed from the locker (recipient %s)."

#. module: bf_property_access_expedibox
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_property_access_expedibox/models/bf_property_access_connector.py:0
msgid "Réservé aux gestionnaires."
msgstr "Reserved for managers."

#. module: bf_property_access_expedibox
#: model:ir.model,name:bf_property_access_expedibox.model_bf_property_access_resident
msgid "Résident (accès)"
msgstr "Resident (access)"

#. module: bf_property_access_expedibox
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_property_access_expedibox/models/bf_property_organisation.py:0
msgid ""
"Seuls les résidents sont inscrits : un accès temporaire (visiteur, "
"entrepreneur, personnel) n'est jamais transmis au casier par le logiciel."
msgstr ""
"Only residents are registered: temporary access (visitor, contractor, "
"staff) is never sent to the locker by the software."

#. module: bf_property_access_expedibox
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:bf_property_access_expedibox.field_bf_property_access_connector__kind
msgid "Type"
msgstr "Type"

#. module: bf_property_access_expedibox
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:bf_property_access_expedibox.field_bf_property_access_point__connector_kind
msgid "Type de connecteur"
msgstr "Connector type"

#. module: bf_property_access_expedibox
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_property_access_expedibox/models/bf_property_access_connector.py:0
msgid ""
"Un accès temporaire ne s'inscrit pas au casier à colis : faites-le à la main"
" au casier si l'organisation le veut, puis cochez cet ordre."
msgstr ""
"Temporary access is not registered with the parcel locker: do it by hand "
"at the locker if the organisation wants it, then tick this order."

#. module: bf_property_access_expedibox
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_property_access_expedibox/models/bf_property_organisation.py:0
msgid ""
"Une correction au dossier (nom, logement) est portée au casier par le "
"passage de nuit (art. 28 : la correction suit le renseignement communiqué)."
msgstr ""
"A correction to the record (name, unit) is carried to the locker by the "
"nightly run (art. 28: a correction follows the information that was "
"disclosed)."

#. module: bf_property_access_expedibox
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_property_access_expedibox/models/bf_property_organisation.py:0
msgid "le courriel et le numéro de mobile"
msgstr "the e-mail and the mobile number"

#. module: bf_property_access_expedibox
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_property_access_expedibox/models/bf_property_organisation.py:0
msgid "le courriel, ou le numéro de mobile à défaut de courriel"
msgstr "the e-mail, or the mobile number when there is no e-mail"

#. module: bf_property_access_expedibox
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_property_access_expedibox/models/bf_property_organisation.py:0
msgid ""
"À encadrer hors du logiciel : entente écrite avec le fournisseur du casier "
"(art. 18.3), lieu d'hébergement de ses serveurs et évaluation préalable s'il"
" est hors Québec (art. 17), durée de conservation chez lui après le retrait."
msgstr ""
"To be settled outside the software: a written agreement with the locker "
"supplier (art. 18.3), where its servers are hosted and a prior assessment "
"if that is outside Québec (art. 17), and how long it keeps the data after "
"the removal."